quest":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102372","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102372","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102372.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102372.patch","merged_at":"2025-03-11T22:02:48Z"},"body":"Closes: godotengine/godot-proposals#4439.\r\n\r\nAllows viewing the default values ​​of the currently used theme item in the Inspector.\r\n\r\nFor theme item properties of resource type, editing the default resource does not make sense. Use **Make Unique** to create a copy before editing.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/37bf8e46-519f-42bc-bdb5-86363778555f\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d01c51d0-bb3b-44b5-aba1-a8980db829b4\r\n\r\nThe value field displays the value of the currently **used** theme item, regardless of whether it is checked or not.\r\n\r\n- When _unchecked_, it simply displays the value **used** by the current theme item. No override is set at this time. This usually means that the property value is **Not Set** or **inhert** (in the control).\r\n- When _checked_, the setting override is displayed, which is also the currently **used** theme item.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":